; A performance fixture: the unit-noisetexture2d-4096-seamless build, moved into an external
; `.tres` material on a 3D mesh. It moves one variable, the file the material comes from. The
; e2e long-task gate opens it and requires no main-thread task over 50 ms while the texture
; builds and uploads, which holds only if a `.tres` material's maps take the same banded upload
; as a scene material's. No golden covers it: unit-noisetexture2d already pins the pixels.

